{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implemented schema migration in `in/schema_migration/client.py`.\n\nChanges:\n- Supports legacy v1, v1.1, v1.2, and already-v2 payloads.\n- Maps customer, order, line-item, shipping, and postal fields per migration notes.\n- Converts numeric strings to integers.\n- Defaults blank/null shipping methods to `\"standard\"`.\n- Preserves legacy unknown fields under `metadata.unknownFields`.\n- Drops configured PII keys from preserved legacy metadata.\n- Keeps v2 metadata and line items intact while normalizing nullable shipping methods.\n- Added `convert_many(payloads)` with aggregated errors containing `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- Writes `conversion_audit.json` on every batch conversion.\n- Added `python -m client input.jsonl output.json` CLI support.\n\nVerification:\n- Python compilation succeeded.\n- Existing test functions executed successfully directly: `tests ok`.\n- Sample JSONL conversion succeeded: 4 converted, 0 errors.\n- CLI smoke check succeeded.\n- Generated audit:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"converted_count\": 4,\n  \"error_count\": 0,\n  \"warning_count\": 0,\n  \"pii_dropped_count\": 5,\n  \"unknown_fields_count\": 5\n}\n```\n\n`pytest` itself was unavailable in the environment (`No module named pytest`), so the test functions and equivalent conversion scenarios were executed directly.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d771f53efec988f016a950c3475a487d2b36134aa84be14a6\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":695,"output":291,"cacheRead":38656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39642,"cost":{"input":0.00013900000000000002,"output":0.0003492,"cacheRead":0.00077312,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00126132}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788152883614,"responseId":"resp_0d771f53efec988f016a950c33dbd487d2915b6ecc4e06a98e","duration":6184.834355999978,"ttft":935.2177169999923},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The project in `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-010345-1ff79379/workspace/in/schema_migration` converts legacy order payloads to a new API shape. The schemas have changed and `client.py` is incomplete.\n\nBefore editing, read `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, and `sample_payloads.jsonl`; they define version-specific field mappings, PII exclusions, and dirty sample records.\n\nYour job:\n- Update `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-010345-1ff79379/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`.\n- Do not edit `old_schema.json`, `new_schema.json`, `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, `sample_payloads.jsonl`, or files under `tests/`.\n- Make `python -m pytest <SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-010345-1ff79379/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests` pass.\n- Preserve backward compatibility with legacy payloads and produce the new schema fields exactly.\n- Support both legacy v1 payloads and already-v2 payloads.\n- Support legacy v1.1 and v1.2 payloads described in `migration_notes.md`, including nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents`.\n- Preserve unknown v2 metadata fields under metadata.unknownFields.\n- For legacy payloads, preserve unmapped extra fields under metadata.unknownFields, except obvious PII-like keys such as `ssn` or `credit_card`.\n- Default blank or null shipping methods to \"standard\".\n- Add error aggregation via convert_many(payloads), returning at least `(converted, errors)` without stopping on the first bad payload. Each error must include `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- If warnings are generated, return them as a third item or include them in a compatible result object. Each warning must include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n- Write `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.6-luna/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.6-luna-20260831-010345-1ff79379/workspace/in/schema_migration/conversion_audit.json` when convert_many is called, summarizing converted_count, error_count, warning_count, pii_dropped_count, and unknown_fields_count.\n- Already-v2 payloads must be idempotent: do not drop metadata.unknownFields or rewrite valid line items.\n- Add CLI support so `python -m client input.jsonl output.json` reads JSONL payloads, writes the converted records as JSON, and writes the audit file next to `client.py`.\n- Hidden checks include multiple line items, alternate legacy shipping postal fields, and error records with useful paths such as `customer_id` or `items[0].qty`.\n\nDo not call external APIs. Do not replace the converter with hard-coded fixture-only output.\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1788152626272},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d771f53efec988f016a950b35214087d2a9b4f43e17c0922f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"0b418157-82ae-4eef-a391-4af998e4a8da\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"0b418157-82ae-4eef-a391-4af998e4a8da\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_CFGbsz5bLHF4fysMsaZEqq4M|fc_0d771f53efec988f016a950b35c1cc87d28782237b56c118bc","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Track schema migration implementation","op":"init","list":[{"phase":"Research","items":["Read migration requirements and current converter","Inspect schemas tests and package entrypoints"]},{"phase":"Implementation","items":["Implement version-aware payload conversion","Add batch aggregation audit and CLI s